<div class="accordion__content is-collapsed" aria-labelledby="accordion-title--24" id="accordion-content--24">
  
                    <div class="aalto-user-generated-content"><h3>CS-E5390</h3>
<h3>12.03.2018-04.05.2018, periods IV-V, 3 cr</h3>
<p>For further information on a&nbsp;topic and an implementation follow the MyCourses pages.</p></div>
            
